DPHKH1  03.01.14  ze dne 9. 3. 2026

Structure version of the bundled dphkh1_epo2.xsd, pinned by hand.

WHY A FILE AND NOT A FIELD IN THE SCHEMA: there isn't one. `verzePis` is
declared `xs:string` with no fixed value or default, and the XSD carries no
version stamp of its own. So a schema refresh CANNOT be detected by
validating, by parsing, or by anything local — a stale copy validates exactly
as cleanly as a current one, and a stale `verzePis` literal in the template
validates too. This file is the only thing that makes a refresh visible.

REFRESH PROCEDURE
  1. Fetch  https://adisspr.mfcr.cz/adis/jepo/schema/dphkh1_epo2.xsd
     (plain curl; no auth, no JS, no postback — unlike the portal pages)
  2. Compare against data/dphkh1_epo2.xsd byte for byte.
  3. Read the Verze / Ze dne stamp from
     https://adisspr.mfcr.cz/dpr/adis/idpr_pub/epo2_info/popis_struktury_detail.faces?zkratka=DPHKH1
     and compare with the line at the top of this file.
  4. If it moved: replace the XSD, update this file, and update the
     `verzePis` literal in report/l10n_cz_kh_templates.xml — they are three
     separate places and nothing keeps them in step automatically.
  5. There is no changelog. Diffing the two XSDs is the only way to see what
     actually changed.

VERIFIED 2026-08-19: the bundled copy is byte-identical to the published one
(md5 1145c9bd07648cde1c09c232dab2b3b5). The template's `verzePis` literal was
